# Host is display-only

`host/` is a PySide6 + pyqtgraph process. It subscribes to ZMQ (`iq`, `detect`, `aoa`, `status`) and sends `tune` / `start` / `stop`.

Never run MUSIC, UHD, or heavy AOA numpy on the Qt GUI thread (or in this process at all).

Never draw a map point / flyer lat-lon from a single-station `AoAResult`. `GeoFix` is invalid.

```text
# BAD
def on_timer():
    theta = music.estimate(iq)  # GUI thread

# GOOD
def on_zmq_aoa(msg: AoAResult):
    polar.set_azimuth(msg.azimuth_deg)
```

No C++ Qt. No web UI as the main interface.
